flowchart TD
  Full[No compatible physical warehouse space] --> Hold[Goods remain aboard / truck warning]
  Hold --> Return[Player confirms return on same present truck]
  Return --> Stop[Stop new unloading / release uncollected claims]
  Stop --> Safe[Actual carries finish safe deposits]
  Safe --> Reload{Optional eligible paid warehouse packages fit?}
  Reload -->|yes| Claim[Reserve exact whole stock IDs + actual truck packing]
  Claim --> Carry[Real one-person or two-person timber haul]
  Carry --> Load[Same truck rear clearance / actual reload]
  Reload -->|no or none selected| Depart[Safe departure with remaining goods]
  Load --> Depart
  Depart --> Exit[Actual truck exit]
  Exit --> Refund[Goods-only refund once / transport fee retained]
  Exit --> Gate[Resolve only this convoy member]
  Gate --> Recovery[Player selects one warehouse bay to clear]
  Recovery --> Stage[Reserve whole supported batch in finite6x4m staging]
  Stage --> Locked[Close source bay to new deposits]
  Locked --> Visit[Real Hauling worker prepares temporary supports]
  Visit --> Move[Physically move same packages / quantities / origin]
  Move --> Empty[Source bay empty / worker reconfigures if needed]
  Empty --> Receipt[New input uses normal warehouse receipt]
  Move --> Consume[Staged stock physically collected for valid use or return]
  Consume --> Clear[Only empty staging admits another batch]
  Forbidden[Staging forbidden as ordinary freight destination or automatic overflow]
